Subject: [PATCH 0/2] arm64: dts: allwinner: Add SPC Glee 10.1 A64 support

Add an initial device tree for the SPC Glee 10.1 tablet based on the
Allwinner A64 and an AXP803 PMIC. This first series deliberately enables
only the hardware that does not depend on downstream driver changes:
battery monitoring, microSD, UART and USB peripheral mode.

Display, touchscreen, Wi-Fi, Bluetooth and audio remain disabled until
their downstream requirements are either removed or replaced by generic
upstream-quality fixes. The eMMC is also left disabled.

The settings come from the known-good staged tree used on the tested
2 GiB RAM / 32 GB eMMC unit. This reduced mainline candidate is currently
build- and schema-tested; a boot test of this exact DTB is still pending.

Validation:

  make dt_binding_check \
    DT_SCHEMA_FILES=Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/sunxi.yaml
  make CHECK_DTBS=y allwinner/sun50i-a64-spc-glee.dtb

